  "title": {
   "en": "Pale Blue"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ペールブルー"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sahara, a perpetual benchwarmer on the baseball team, was contemplating quitting as he'd lost sight of why he continued playing. That's when he spotted Ando, his childhood friend and the team's female manager, by the riverbank. Under the scorching summer sky, their fleeting youth begins to stir once more!",
   "ja": "野球部万年補欠の佐原は、なんの為に野球を続けているのかわからなくなり退部届けを出そうか悩んでいた中、幼馴染で野球部の女子マネージャー安藤を河原で見かける。暑い真夏の空の下、一度きりの青春が再び動き出す――!!"
  },
